Bug Report 3: No Option to Increase Product Quantity in Cart

Severity: Low
 Reason: Reduces usability by forcing users to return to the product page to add more quantities.

Steps to Reproduce:

Login with valid credentials.
Add a product to the cart.
Navigate to the Cart page.
Review available cart actions.

Expected Result:
 Users should be able to increase or decrease product quantity directly from the Cart page.

Actual Result:
 No option is available on the Cart page to modify product quantity. Users must navigate back to the product listing page to add additional quantities.